#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:1
msgid "接入 Jetson / 树莓派"
msgstr "Integrating with Jetson / Raspberry Pi"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D20 或 HM-D13** 通过串口接入 Jetson、树莓派等 Linux 主控，并使用 "
"`D20_ros_driver` 发布 ROS 定位话题。可使用产品标配的 **3.3 V USB 转 UART 转接"
"器**，也可使用主板的 **3.3 V UART GPIO**。"
msgstr ""
"Connect **HM-D20 or HM-D13** to a Linux host such as Jetson or Raspberry Pi "
"via serial port, and use `D20_ros_driver` to publish ROS localization "
"topics. Use the supplied **3.3 V USB-to-UART adapter** or the board's **3.3 "
"V UART GPIO**."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:10
msgid ""
"接入前先完成差分链路 **4G 版本**先完成 [4G/CORS 配置](../differential-"
"links/4g-ntrip.md)；**LoRa 版本**先完成 [基站与移动站连接](../differential-"
"links/lora.md)。差分链路由设备内部完成，驱动读取设备已输出的定位结果。"
msgstr ""
"Before connecting, complete the correction link first. For the **4G "
"version**, first complete the [4G/CORS configuration](../differential-"
"links/4g-ntrip.md); for the **LoRa version**, first complete the [base "
"station and rover connection](../differential-links/lora.md). The correction "
"link is completed internally by the device, and the driver reads the "
"positioning results already output by the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:13
msgid ""
"驱动可解析 NMEA 或 UBX；接线前按[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-"
"output.md)确认当前输出。"
msgstr ""
"The driver parses NMEA or UBX. Before wiring, confirm the current output in "
"[Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:15
msgid "接线安全边界"
msgstr "Wiring Safety Boundary"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:17
msgid ""
"D20/D13 设备供电为 **5 V ±0.5 V**（4.5–5.5 V）。Jetson/树莓派 GPIO 的 3.3 V "
"只能作为 UART 信号，不能给设备供电。"
msgstr ""
"The D20/D13 device is powered by **5 V ±0.5 V** (4.5–5.5 V). The 3.3 V from "
"Jetson/Raspberry Pi GPIO can only be used as a UART signal and cannot power "
"the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:18
msgid ""
"设备 UART I/O 电平为 **3.3 V**，产品标配的 USB 转 UART 转接器和主板 UART 均须"
"遵守该电平；使用 5 V UART 电平可能损坏设备，禁止直接连接 RS232。"
msgstr ""
"The device UART I/O level is **3.3 V**. Both the supplied USB-to-UART "
"adapter and the board UART must use this logic level. 5 V UART logic may "
"damage the device; do not connect an RS232 interface directly."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:19
msgid "设备与主控共地，设备 TX 接主控 RX，设备 RX 接主控 TX。"
msgstr ""
"Connect device ground to host ground, device TX to host RX, and device RX to "
"host TX."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:20
msgid ""
"上电前必须按 Pin 顺序核对线束；不要按颜色、插头外形或其他设备线序接线。电源正"
"极接到 TX/RX 会损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"Before power-on, verify every wire by pin number. Do not rely on wire color, "
"connector shape, or another device's pinout. Connecting supply voltage to TX "
"or RX will damage the receiver."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:22
msgid ""
"完整定义请查看：[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md)、[D13 接口与接"
"线](../operation/d13-wiring.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For the complete definition, see: [D20 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/"
"d20-wiring.md), [D13 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d13-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:24
msgid "D20 接 Jetson / 树莓派"
msgstr "D20 Connects to Jetson / Raspberry Pi"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:26
msgid "D20 使用 8-pin GH1.25 mm 接口，ROS 串口接入至少需要："
msgstr ""
"The D20 uses an 8-pin GH1.25 mm interface, and at least the following is "
"required to connect the ROS serial port:"

