msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "RXD"
msgstr "RXD"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "TXD"
msgstr "TXD"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "PPS"
msgstr "PPS"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "可选 3.3 V 秒脉冲输出"
msgstr "Optional 3.3 V pulse-per-second output"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:49
msgid ""
"D13 移动站按 Pin 1–5 顺序连接，不能通过颜色判断功能。D13 LoRa 基站使用配套的"
"封装 4-pin USB 线缆进行供电或连接电脑查看串口数据；ROS 定位主控应连接 D13 "
"LoRa 移动站。"
msgstr ""
"D13 rover should be connected in the order of Pin 1–5, and the function "
"cannot be determined by color. The D13 LoRa base station uses the matching "
"sealed 4-pin USB cable for power supply or to connect to a computer to view "
"serial port data; the ROS positioning master controller should be connected "
"to the D13 LoRa rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:51
msgid "连接方式 A：标配 USB 转 UART 转接器"
msgstr "Connection method A: Supplied USB-to-UART adapter"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:53
msgid "使用产品标配的 USB 转 UART 转接器，按上表交叉连接 TX/RX 并连接 GND。"
msgstr ""
"Use the supplied USB-to-UART adapter, cross-connect TX/RX as shown in the "
"table above, and connect GND."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:54
msgid ""
"设备 5 V 由 D20 Pin 6 或 D13 Pin 2 单独提供；转接器的 USB 口用于串口数据时，"
"不要默认其能提供合规的设备电源。"
msgstr ""
"Supply 5 V to the device separately through D20 Pin 6 or D13 Pin 2. When the "
"adapter's USB port is used for serial data, do not assume that it provides a "
"compliant device power supply."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:55
msgid "插入 Jetson/树莓派后查看设备名："
msgstr "Check the device name after inserting Jetson/Raspberry Pi:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:61
msgid ""
"常见设备名为 `/dev/ttyUSB0` 或 `/dev/ttyACM0`。如设备名变化，优先使用 `/dev/"
"serial/by-id/` 下的稳定路径。"
msgstr ""
"Common device names are `/dev/ttyUSB0` or `/dev/ttyACM0`. If the device name "
"changes, it is preferable to use the stable path under `/dev/serial/by-id/`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:63
msgid "连接方式 B：主板 UART 直连"
msgstr "Connection Method B: Direct UART Connection to Motherboard"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:65
msgid "查阅所用 Jetson 载板或树莓派型号资料，确认目标 UART 为 3.3 V 电平。"
msgstr ""
"Check the documentation for the Jetson carrier board or Raspberry Pi model "
"being used to confirm that the target UART is at 3.3 V level."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:66
msgid "设备 TX 接主控 RX，设备 RX 接主控 TX，设备 GND 接主控 GND。"
msgstr ""
"Device TX connects to the main control RX, device RX connects to the main "
"control TX, device GND connects to the main control GND."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:67
msgid ""
"设备 5 V 由独立电源输入，不能把 D20 Pin 6 或 D13 Pin 2 接到 3.3 V GPIO。"
msgstr ""
"The device's 5 V is powered by an independent power supply, and D20 Pin 6 or "
"D13 Pin 2 cannot be connected to the 3.3 V GPIO."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:68
msgid "确认 Linux 已启用 UART，并关闭占用该串口的登录控制台或其他服务。"
msgstr ""
"Make sure that UART is enabled on Linux, and disable the login console or "
"other services that occupy this serial port."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:69
msgid "查看串口设备名："
msgstr "Check the serial port device name:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:75
msgid ""
"不同 Jetson 载板和树莓派型号的 UART 引脚、设备名和启用方式可能不同，以实际硬"
"件资料为准。"
msgstr ""
"The UART pins, device names, and enabling methods of different Jetson "
"carrier boards and Raspberry Pi models may vary, so refer to the actual "
"hardware documentation."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:77
msgid "安装驱动"
msgstr "Install driver"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:79
msgid "驱动源码：<https://github.com/Hessian-matrix/D20_ros_driver>"
msgstr "Driver source code: <https://github.com/Hessian-matrix/D20_ros_driver>"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:81
msgid "包名和可执行文件名均为 `d20_ros_driver`。"
msgstr ""
"The package name and the executable file name are both `d20_ros_driver`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:83
msgid "ROS1 Noetic"
msgstr "ROS1 Noetic"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:96
msgid "如果缺少 `empy`，安装 `python3-empy` 后重新编译。"
msgstr "If `empy` is missing, reinstall after installing `python3-empy`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:98
msgid "ROS2"
msgstr "ROS2"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:111
msgid "配置串口"
msgstr "Configure serial port"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:113
msgid "复制仓库中的 `config/config.yaml`，按实际产品和串口修改："
msgstr ""
"Copy `config/config.yaml` from the repository and modify it according to the "
"actual product and serial port:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:125
msgid ""
"`sku` 填写 `D20` 或 `D13`，`serial_port` 填写 Jetson/树莓派实际识别到的路径。"
msgstr ""
"`sku` should be filled in with `D20` or `D13`, and `serial_port` should be "
"filled in with the path actually recognized by Jetson/Raspberry Pi."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:127
msgid "话题与验证"
msgstr "Topics and Verification"

