msgstr "`/d20_rtk/navsatfix`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "`sensor_msgs/NavSatFix`"
msgstr "`sensor_msgs/NavSatFix`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "经纬度、椭球高、时间戳、定位状态和协方差"
msgstr ""
"Latitude and longitude, ellipsoidal height, timestamp, positioning status, "
"and covariance"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "`/rtk_nmea`"
msgstr "`/rtk_nmea`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "`std_msgs/String`"
msgstr "`std_msgs/String`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:9
msgid "原始 NMEA；仅在 `publish_nmea: true` 时发布"
msgstr "Raw NMEA; only published when `publish_nmea: true`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:134
msgid "状态约定：`-1` 无定位，`0` 普通定位，`1` RTK 浮点解，`2` RTK 固定解。"
msgstr ""
"Status Convention: `-1` No positioning, `0` Normal positioning, `1` RTK "
"Float solution, `2` RTK Fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:136
msgid "ROS1："
msgstr "ROS1:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:144
msgid "ROS2："
msgstr "ROS2:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:152
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:155
msgid ""
"定位话题持续发布，并能被驱动按当前输出协议解析；开阔环境进入固定解时，"
"`NavSatFix.status.status` 为 `2`。"
msgstr ""
"The driver publishes the positioning topic continuously and parses the "
"current output protocol. When the receiver reaches a fixed solution with an "
"open sky view, `NavSatFix.status.status` is `2`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:158
msgid ""
"设备未固定时，先按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation."
"md)排查差分链路和卫星环境。"
msgstr ""
"When the equipment is not fixed, first check the correction link and "
"satellite environment according to [RTK Status and Fixed Solution Validation]"
"(../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:160
msgid "Viobot2 的专用流程请查看[接入 Viobot2](viobot2.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For the dedicated process of Viobot2, see [Access Viobot2](viobot2.md)."

